      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load CLIP (the model that looks at your pictures)</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">9.35 GB</span></a>\\n</span>&nbsp;\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders</div><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Qwen3-VL 8B is a language model that can see. It reads each picture and writes the text. If you already have it from the Qwen Image 2.1 workflows, it is the same file.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;After placing the files, restart ComfyUI or refresh model lists using the <b>R</b> shortcut.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Nodes Installed from Manager</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li>Pixaroma, version <b>1.4.204</b> or newer. A node shows red or missing? Update Pixaroma.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p><p><b>Which version is the newest?</b> The <b>Latest Pixaroma version</b> button shows it and what is new in it. The help page has the update steps for every kind of install.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/latest/?need=1.4.204\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Latest Pixaroma version</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/#update\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">How to update Pixaroma</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"puzzle\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Something missing?</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Each button opens a short video that shows the fix, with the steps written under it.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/missing-nodes/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Red or missing nodes</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/missing-models/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">A model file is missing</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/refresh/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Buttons missing after an update</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"pixaroma\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Resources</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-discord\\\" href=\\\"https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Join Discord</a>&nbsp;\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-yt\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Pixaroma YouTube Channel</a>&nbsp;\\n  <span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/report/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Ask for help</a></span>&nbsp;\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Download Models\",\"icon\":\"download-model\",\"color\":\"#f66744\"}}"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "note_json": "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load CLIP (the model that looks at your pictures)</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">9.35 GB</span></a>\\n</span>&nbsp;\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders</div><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Qwen3-VL 8B is a language model that can see. It reads each picture and writes the text. If you already have it from the Qwen Image 2.1 workflows, it is the same file.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;After placing the files, restart ComfyUI or refresh model lists using the <b>R</b> shortcut.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Nodes Installed from Manager</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li>Pixaroma, version <b>1.4.204</b> or newer. A node shows red or missing? Update Pixaroma.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p><p><b>Which version is the newest?</b> The <b>Latest Pixaroma version</b> button shows it and what is new in it. The help page has the update steps for every kind of install.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/latest/?need=1.4.204\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Latest Pixaroma version</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/#update\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">How to update Pixaroma</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"puzzle\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Something missing?</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Each button opens a short video that shows the fix, with the steps written under it.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/missing-nodes/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Red or missing nodes</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/missing-models/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">A model file is missing</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/refresh/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Buttons missing after an update</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"pixaroma\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Resources</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-discord\\\" href=\\\"https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Join Discord</a>&nbsp;\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-yt\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Pixaroma YouTube Channel</a>&nbsp;\\n  <span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://workflows.pixaroma.com/help/report/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Ask for help</a></span>&nbsp;\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Download Models\",\"icon\":\"download-model\",\"color\":\"#f66744\"}}"
