        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>RUN TIMES</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Measured on a <b>24 GB RTX 4090</b> with this workflow, with the models already loaded. A different card gives different numbers, but the shape holds: the time grows with the number of pictures and their size.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><table class=\\\"pix-note-grid\\\" style=\\\"--pix-note-grid-border: #f66744; --pix-note-grid-header-bg: #1a1a1a\\\"><thead><tr><th>What</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Each answer</td><td>under 1 s</td></tr><tr><td>4 pictures (the demo)</td><td>about 5 s</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The answer is one word, so the AI is fast: a folder of 100 pictures takes about a minute. Qwen3-VL 8B needs about 10 GB of video memory.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;The first Run of the session</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The first Run after starting ComfyUI also has to load the models from disk (about 18 GB for Klein and its text encoder), so it takes longer. After that they stay loaded.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"run-timer\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;On a 16 GB card</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Timed on an <b>RTX 4060 Ti 16 GB</b> with 32 GB of RAM:</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li>The AI text step took about <b>2 times</b> as long.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Run Times\",\"icon\":\"run-timer\",\"color\":\"#3f9a4f\"}}"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "note_json": "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>RUN TIMES</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Measured on a <b>24 GB RTX 4090</b> with this workflow, with the models already loaded. A different card gives different numbers, but the shape holds: the time grows with the number of pictures and their size.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><table class=\\\"pix-note-grid\\\" style=\\\"--pix-note-grid-border: #f66744; --pix-note-grid-header-bg: #1a1a1a\\\"><thead><tr><th>What</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Each answer</td><td>under 1 s</td></tr><tr><td>4 pictures (the demo)</td><td>about 5 s</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The answer is one word, so the AI is fast: a folder of 100 pictures takes about a minute. Qwen3-VL 8B needs about 10 GB of video memory.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;The first Run of the session</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The first Run after starting ComfyUI also has to load the models from disk (about 18 GB for Klein and its text encoder), so it takes longer. After that they stay loaded.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"run-timer\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;On a 16 GB card</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Timed on an <b>RTX 4060 Ti 16 GB</b> with 32 GB of RAM:</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li>The AI text step took about <b>2 times</b> as long.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Run Times\",\"icon\":\"run-timer\",\"color\":\"#3f9a4f\"}}"
